age/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore +22</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative Energy and Poison spells gain a 22% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Superior_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Superior False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Superior_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Superior False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +40 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus +10</a>:</b> +10 Equipment bonus to the DC of Necromancy spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Boon_of_Undeath\" title=\"Boon of Undeath\">Boon of Undeath</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Boon_of_Undeath\" title=\"Boon of Undeath\">Boon of Undeath</a>:</b> Undead take solace in the hate of others. Every time a character wearing a Boon of Undeath item is struck in combat, an <a href=\"/page/Inflict_Light_Wounds\" title=\"Inflict Light Wounds\">Inflict Light Wounds</a> spell will be cast on the character.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Robe_of_Shadow_(level_32).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_32%29.png/420px-Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_32%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"616\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Robe_of_Shadow_%28level_32%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This robe is as dark as the night sky and almost seems to crawl visibly with moving shadows. It boosts the power of the wearer's negative energy magic, and grants a measure of necromantic protection against enemy attacks.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817060750\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCompl